{"ID":"20240220132636-iyt7sxr","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132636-iyt7sxr","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132636-iyt7sxr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312161259-h2obibn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312161259-i1mrajt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312161259-i1mrajt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:10,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:10\u0026#125;","title":"【苓桂术甘汤】（茯苓桂枝白朮甘草汤）","type":"doc","updated":"20240312161259"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312161259-h2obibn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161259-h2obibn","updated":"20240312161259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第七十二条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161259-t6mqkmv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161259-t6mqkmv","updated":"20240312161259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」,若吐若下后,心下逆满,气上冲胸,起则头眩,脉沉紧,发汗则动经,身为振振摇者,「茯苓桂枝白朮甘草汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161259-ou6qqpu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161259-ou6qqpu","updated":"20240312161259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们在心下这个地方，就是胃的地方，刚好跟我们横膈膜靠在一起的地方。平常水从大肠升上来，进入肺。如果说这个人是伤寒，伤于寒的时候我们应该要发表，结果来不及发表，病人吃坏食物了上吐下泻，津液虚了。到你手上的时候，你没有注意他吐泻过，你给他处方，发汗的药，也就是说他先伤到肠胃的津液以后，吃了发汗的药，吃到发汗的药，吃坏肚子本来已经伤到肠胃的津液了，再一发汗，肺里面的津液不够了。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"上面的水是麻黄汤发汗，肺里面的津液没了，上吐下泻肠胃的津液没了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，水气停在横隔的地方没有办法动。简单讲是这样子，我们身上一个东西缺掉，一个东西一定会去补位，你上吐下泻以后。本身就有伤寒，表面上的汗水堵在那边，你汗水没有办法排掉，你吃坏肚子，上面的津液没有办法补位，因为水气不通，你再开发表的药，肺里面的津液流汗流掉了，伤寒的症状没了，恶寒、头痛、身痛、发烧的症状没了。麻黄汤把肺里面津液停掉，津液会停在横隔来不及补充，这是津液受到伤害了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161259-12jfid9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161259-12jfid9","updated":"20240312161259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脉会沉紧，代表里寒，沉就是里，紧就是寒。这个时候会晃动，晃动的原因是横隔，横膈膜像海绵一样会吸水。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"中医认为，中焦横隔像天平的底座，当你横隔有水，没有办法排掉，人一动水就跟着动，上面会晃动，就会产生头眩。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苓桂术甘汤，你看白术跟茯苓是去中焦，桂枝能够降逆。所以苓桂术甘汤下去，中焦的水会排出来。一排出来，头昏现象就去掉了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161259-u3itn5b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161259-u3itn5b","updated":"20240312161259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 151px;","style":"width: 141px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240228102945-wgqjj10.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 141px;\" parent-style=\"width: 151px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240312161259-exitqgi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161259-exitqgi","updated":"20240312161259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"很多人站起来就会头昏，起则头眩，他不起，躺或坐在那就不会头眩，站起来就会头昏，就是苓桂术甘汤症。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"躺下去，不动就会头昏，不是苓桂术甘汤症。苓桂术甘汤就是起这头眩，动才会晕眩，中焦横隔水堵在这边。原因很多，不单单是因为你伤寒，上吐下泻以后，常常运动完口很渴，喝水喝很快，堵在中膈也会头昏。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161259-vwiv9es","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161259-vwiv9es","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312161259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓桂枝白朮甘草汤方（苓桂术甘汤）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312161259-gmoe6xa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161259-gmoe6xa","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312161259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓四两，桂枝三两去皮，白朮二两，甘草二两。右四味,以水六升,煮取三升,去滓,分温三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312161259-aq6i2dk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161259-aq6i2dk","updated":"20240312161259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最重的剂量是茯苓，所以茯苓利水的力量很强。如果病人起则头眩，临床上看到，不单单是这样，还有恶心，我常常在苓桂术甘汤里加一点半夏在里面，把水排掉，因为我们知道是水。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161259-i1mrajt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161259-i1mrajt","updated":"20240312161259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个水饮是停在中膈。"}]}]}